<title>UK: BHW sets 250 million mark three-year FRN.</title>
<headline>BHW sets 250 million mark three-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Nord Landesbank and Bankgesllschaft Berlin.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BHW BAUSPARKASSE AG</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    03.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     0.0625    PAY DATE    03.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.18 PCT  ISSUE	100.03</p>
<p> LISTING    HANNOVER  DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    8 BP	SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
